    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>✈️2023年，位于深圳的Eleven与远在北京的Black合手做了一档播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a"><strong><span>《马上回来》</span></strong></a><span>，由于种种原因，这个“马上”拖了整整1年，实在缺乏诚信，如同中国人爱说“马上到！改天吃饭”却没有下文，这期流产的节目终于在2025年初与大家见面。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为引子，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a"><strong><span>《马上回来》</span></strong></a><span>这档情感陪伴类播客也将在近期正式上线，感兴趣的听众可移步订阅。与《食色城市》的向外探索精神不同，</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a"><strong><span>《马上回来》</span></strong></a><span>更关注向内探索，由两位极致i人的中年loser主持，同样欢迎大家订阅&amp;收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>✈</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/64cf823aa13f9c72a2fd364a"><strong><span>《马上回来》</span></strong></a><span>主播：Black &amp; Eleven</span></p><span></span><p><span>策划：Black &amp; Eleven</span></p><span></span><p><span>后期/制作/发布：Eleven</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐采样：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>City Dreams - Glimlip / Yasper / Cocabona</span></p>]]></description>
