  <item>
    <title>05 感性互助会 与z世代聊聊焦虑与忧愁</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e2f6c73a5ff0a0ca03222e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e2f6c73a5ff0a0ca03222e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 13:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🥃上一期播客与银行从业者乔一、音乐人木木聊了城市的文化生活差异，本期话锋一转，我们打开内心、摘下面具，聊聊z世代眼中城市人最真实的烦恼、焦虑与落地的快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你还记得最近一次哭是什么时候吗？希望这期感性至极的播客可以与你形成互助关系，围坐在一起吐露烦恼，喝点吃点，消解一丢丢忧愁。</span></p><span></span><p><span>上期任意门：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d6e5684a0f950f843b257c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d6e5684a0f950f843b257c"><span>粤语川话大对决</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🧭指南针：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 95后的男生对30大寿有多恐惧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="731">12:11</a> 乐观点，人生各个年龄段都有新烦恼，比好不如比烂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">18:13</a> 成熟还是有那么点好处的，但不多</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1317">21:57</a> 转了一大圈，发觉好生活就在眼前</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a> 再老点，连个陪你说话的人都没了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 趁早培养自我对话的习惯，可以防止中年孤独</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1745">29:05</a> 30后过生日的体验，派对结束了🥀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2410">40:10</a> go out the door之细微小事的美好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2784">46:24</a> 你还记得你最近一次流眼泪吗？3人感性分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">01:03:03</a> 深度对话之必要，人与人需要连接</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4223">01:10:23</a> 95后00后的共性：每一代人都是套圈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4477">01:14:37</a> 信息大爆炸，快餐时代来临</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5351">01:29:11</a> 焦虑解法之回归艺术，回归简单生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5532">01:32:12</a> 极繁设计，人与生活各类小事的效率斗争</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6136">01:42:16</a> 真实发言：你会屏蔽朋友的朋友圈吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>返场嘉宾：木木 （网易云音乐 @蒋卓木木）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：乔一 （🍠 @卡卡）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播/策划/后期：Eleven（ig:milkydemo）</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作：milkydemo1988@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>宣传依然在打地基……</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔖相关：</span></p><span></span><p><span>听众朋友可以通过关注公众号《食性者》进行投稿互动，我们会收录有趣的故事在相应的城市主题节目中播出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️不出意外，坚持一周一更；出了意外，保证一月一更。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬原声采样：</span></p><span></span><p><span>· &nbsp;《饮食男女》李安 1994</span></p><span></span><p><span>· &nbsp;《麦兜故事》粤语版 2001</span></p><span></span><p><span>· &nbsp;《欲望与都市sex and the city》 S4/EP01 &nbsp;2001</span></p><span></span><p><span>🦜音乐采样：</span></p><span></span><p><span>· intro &nbsp;hot house - Berlioz</span></p><span></span><p><span>· outro 巴士光年 - 吴林峰</span></p>]]></description>
