  <item>
    <title>04 广东vs四川 城市印象的A面B面</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66d6e5684a0f950f843b257c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66d6e5684a0f950f843b257c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Sep 2024 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>🏝️老广务实又精明，川人散漫又悠闲，但当一名广东人选择在成都生活，他内心打着怎样的“小算盘”呢？本期播客将由同样95后的四川代表木木（独立音乐人）与广东代表乔一（银行从业者）聊聊各自眼中城市的A面B面，并送出精彩（lakua）万分的方言对决🔥</span></p><span></span><p><span>🧭指南针：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 四川人对粤语的执着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 史上最强粤语川话大battle</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="395">06:35</a> i人震惊！e人神奇的社交方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="848">14:08</a> 为什么爱上一座城，东西文化差别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> 得闲饮茶：广东人早茶到底吃什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1690">28:10</a> 我们不能放过叉烧！多邻国还需加把力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 内地人看tvb，广东人看吉尼斯神剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 对广东人来说，哪里都是北方</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2433">40:33</a> 城市的虚假繁荣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3223">53:43</a> 人际交往的巨大区别：一个热情/一个温和</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5160">01:26:00</a> 咖啡厅的偶然面基，go out the door</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5385">01:29:45</a> 乔一推荐：成都极简风格的咖啡厅</span></p><span></span><p><span>返场嘉宾：木木 （网易云音乐 @蒋卓木木）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：乔一 （🍠 @卡卡）</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播/策划/后期：川哥（ig:milkydemo）</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作：milkydemo1988@gmail.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>宣传依然在打地基……</span></p><span></span><p><span>🔖相关：</span></p><span></span><p><span>听众朋友可以通过关注公众号《食性者》进行投稿互动，我们会收录有趣的故事在相应的城市主题节目中播出。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⚠️不出意外，坚持一周一更；出了意外，保证一月一更。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬原声采样：</span></p><span></span><p><span>· &nbsp;《饮食男女》李安 1994</span></p><span></span><p><span>· &nbsp;《麦兜故事》粤语版 2001</span></p><span></span><p><span>· &nbsp;《欲望与都市sex and the city》 S4/EP01 &nbsp;2001</span></p><span></span><p><span>🦜音乐采样：</span></p><span></span><p><span>· intro &nbsp;hot house - Berlioz</span></p><span></span><p><span>· outro 而家到咗夏天未 - 灵山村帮/邓乐怡</span></p>]]></description>
